#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "That GPU node or GPU does not exist, or is on a device you do not have access to."
msgstr "Šis GPU mezgls vai GPU neeksistē vai atrodas ierīcē, kurai jums nav piekļuves."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU data query could not be added to the device. Check that the plugin's templates are installed."
msgstr "GPU datu vaicājumu nevarēja pievienot ierīcei. Pārbaudiet, vai ir instalētas spraudņa veidnes."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: the node's device was deleted, so the node can only be disabled."
msgstr "Ierīce: mezgla ierīce tika dzēsta, tāpēc mezglu var tikai atspējot."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: choose an existing Cacti device."
msgstr "Ierīce: izvēlieties esošu Cacti ierīci."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Device: this device is already a GPU node."
msgstr "Ierīce: šī ierīce jau ir GPU mezgls."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was saved."
msgstr "GPU mezgls tika saglabāts."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node could not be saved."
msgstr "GPU mezglu nevarēja saglabāt."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was removed. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "GPU mezgls tika noņemts. Tā Cacti ierīce tika atstāta neskarta."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU node was not removed because GPU records belong to it. Disable it instead; GPU records are never deleted."
msgstr "GPU mezgls netika noņemts, jo tam pieder GPU ieraksti. Tā vietā atspējojiet to; GPU ieraksti nekad netiek dzēsti."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU now belongs to the node it was seen at, with its history."
msgstr "GPU tagad pieder mezglam, kurā tas tika redzēts, kopā ar savu vēsturi."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU stays with its recorded node."
msgstr "GPU paliek pie sava reģistrētā mezgla."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU will leave the data query at the next reindex. Its graphs and RRD files are kept."
msgstr "GPU tiks izņemts no datu vaicājuma nākamajā pārindeksēšanā. Tā grafiki un RRD faili tiek saglabāti."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Only an absent GPU can be removed from the data query."
msgstr "No datu vaicājuma var noņemt tikai iztrūkstošu GPU."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Creating a device needs permission to manage Cacti devices."
msgstr "Ierīces izveidei nepieciešama atļauja pārvaldīt Cacti ierīces."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Description: enter up to 150 printable characters."
msgstr "Apraksts: ievadiet līdz 150 drukājamām rakstzīmēm."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "Hostname: enter a host name or IP address."
msgstr "Resursdatora nosaukums: ievadiet resursdatora nosaukumu vai IP adresi."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU Node device template is not installed."
msgstr "GPU mezgla ierīces veidne nav instalēta."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device was not kept: your account may not see devices it creates. Ask an administrator to create it."
msgstr "Ierīce netika saglabāta: jūsu konts nevar redzēt paša izveidotās ierīces. Lūdziet administratoram to izveidot."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be removed after access was refused. Ask an administrator to remove it."
msgstr "Pēc piekļuves atteikuma ierīci nevarēja noņemt. Lūdziet administratoram to noņemt."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device and its GPU node were created. Set the device's SNMP settings on its device page."
msgstr "Ierīce un tās GPU mezgls tika izveidoti. Konfigurējiet ierīces SNMP iestatījumus tās ierīces lapā."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The device could not be created; see the Cacti log."
msgstr "Ierīci nevarēja izveidot; skatiet Cacti žurnālu."

#: gpu_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Uzraudzības skats"

#: gpu_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Novērojumus nevarēja nolasīt. Lūdziet administratoram pārbaudīt spraudņa žurnālu."

